  "description": "MIHJAR crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I 41/a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C76 H40 F36 N8 O20 Pr4. From the CIF bond table, Pr1 (Pr) has 7 O neighbors; Pr2 (Pr) has 7 O neighbors; Pr3 (Pr) has 7 O neighbors; Pr4 (Pr) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.969-4.112 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 105.29-112.73°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C76H40N8O20F36Pr4.",
